-- ซอฟต์แวร์" under the programme Inspire & Share: จุดประกายความรู้สู่ทุกคน,
-- from its real poster and announcement, with the department newsletter
-- (จดหมายข่าว ฉบับที่ 70, ก.ย. 2569) as its SAR recap poster.
--
-- Sat 12 Sep 2569 (2026), 08.30–16.30, ห้อง 1639 ชั้น 6 อาคารวิทยาศาสตร์ 1;
-- speaker ดร.ภควัต นาควิจิตร, independent researcher (named in the
-- description: events have no speaker field). For CS and IT students.
-- Finished and closed, with certificates (their evaluations and certificates
-- come from seed_certificates.sql, which must run after this file). The
-- announcement registered people through a Google Form; here they register
-- in the system, so that link is left out. Budget and who is responsible
-- follow the department's budget plan (แผนพัฒนานักศึกษา ภาควิชาคอมพิวเตอร์
-- ปีงบประมาณ 2569, item 11 Inspire & Share: 20,000 baht, อ.ดร.ภูริวัจน์).
--
-- Who came: half of the demo students (none suspended); one registered but
-- didn't come.
--
-- Apply AFTER schema, seed, demo_organizer, seed_blacklist. Safe to run
-- again: it removes event 1055 (registrations, check-ins, evaluations,
-- certificates and SAR cascade) first — then run seed_certificates.sql again.
--   docker exec -i cpsu-etms-mysql mysql --default-character-set=utf8mb4 -uroot cpsu_etms < database/seed_llm_rag.sql
-- =====================================================================

USE cpsu_etms;
SET NAMES utf8mb4;

DELETE FROM events WHERE id = 1055;

